Panel 1: Total Security Events
Displays total ingested security events in the environment.

spl
index=main sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security"
| stats count

Panel 2: Event Trend Over Time
Shows event activity over time.

index=main sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security"
| timechart count


Panel 3: User Activity Analysis
Extracts user activity from Windows Security logs.


index=main sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security"
| search "Account"
| rex field=_raw "Account Name:\s*(?<user>[A-Za-z0-9_\$-]+)"
| stats count by user
| sort - count


Panel 4: Host/System Activity
Displays event distribution across hosts.

index=main sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security"
| stats count by host
| sort - count


Panel 5: Anomaly / High Activity Detection
Highlights users with unusually high activity.

index=main sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security"
| search "Account"
| rex field=_raw "Account Name:\s*(?<user>[A-Za-z0-9_\$-]+)"
| stats count by user
| sort - count
